{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01W2z6u48mE7ruGEe22DNPVT","lastSequenceNum":0,"ownerAccountUuid":"eb1ff47f-cfbf-49b1-a15e-4ca693f2c22a","ownerOrganizationUuid":"af454b37-7570-4ffb-9890-36a908611f8b"}
{"parentUuid":"8fbbaf73-c905-4802-bba3-0b72b25e7a8e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoZrzxAZNNtA5MeZZ5gd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WVPLfzUVDRnFNnKyWjfyQK","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md","content":"# viktortrilar: viktor/bim\n**Goal:** the bird's-eye floor layout Alpo asked for, plus a DXF export, fitted around Sasha's BIM mode on `yasasha/bim`\n**Done:** uncommitted on this branch: app/plan/ (floor image, walls, DXF, IFC), /api/plan routes, web/plan.js and the Plan button, `make bim`, tests/test_plan.py, USAGE. Checked `yasasha/bim` against main: it has the better IFC export, so mine should go. Plan and DXF don't overlap with it\n**Verified:** 9 plan tests passed earlier. Plan screen runs on real data in a headless browser: search, tap, route, no page errors. Main merged with `yasasha/bim` in a scratch copy: no conflicts, 205 tests passed, 19 skipped, lint clean, 0 IFC schema issues, a move in BIM mode took the route from 4.35 to 5.5 m. Not tested: a real BIM tool, 5090, tablet\n**Next:** once Viktor agrees, build on Sasha's branch: remove my IFC export and `make bim`, and use Sasha's `estimate_room` for walls. Then fix the Plan screen: info panel opens behind it, labels overlap, P-005 should show as `P-005?`, the proxy drops the DXF's headers, and the DXF download came back empty in the test browser (cause unknown)\n**Blockers:** waiting on Viktor's decision. Sasha's branch needs a fix for `obj-0144` (fitted 2.08 m across, through the wall) and its usage note, because `make bim` can't pick up operator changes. An agent is fixing routes that ignore moved objects on `viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects`, not finished. Roihu closed until at least Monday. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":939,"cache_read_input_tokens":191750,"output_tokens":742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":939,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":191750,"cache_creation_input_tokens":939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":939},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":6250,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WVPLfzUVDRnFNnKyWjfyQK":{"file_path":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md","content":"# viktortrilar: viktor/bim\n**Goal:** the bird's-eye floor layout Alpo asked for, plus a DXF export, fitted around Sasha's BIM mode on `yasasha/bim`\n**Done:** uncommitted on this branch: app/plan/ (floor image, walls, DXF, IFC), /api/plan routes, web/plan.js and the Plan button, `make bim`, tests/test_plan.py, USAGE. Checked `yasasha/bim` against main: it has the better IFC export, so mine should go. Plan and DXF don't overlap with it\n**Verified:** 9 plan tests passed earlier. Plan screen runs on real data in a headless browser: search, tap, route, no page errors. Main merged with `yasasha/bim` in a scratch copy: no conflicts, 205 tests passed, 19 skipped, lint clean, 0 IFC schema issues, a move in BIM mode took the route from 4.35 to 5.5 m. Not tested: a real BIM tool, 5090, tablet\n**Next:** once Viktor agrees, build on Sasha's branch: remove my IFC export and `make bim`, and use Sasha's `estimate_room` for walls. Then fix the Plan screen: info panel opens behind it, labels overlap, P-005 should show as `P-005?`, the proxy drops the DXF's headers, and the DXF download came back empty in the test browser (cause unknown)\n**Blockers:** waiting on Viktor's decision. Sasha's branch needs a fix for `obj-0144` (fitted 2.08 m across, through the wall) and its usage note, because `make bim` can't pick up operator changes. An agent is fixing routes that ignore moved objects on `viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects`, not finished. Roihu closed until at least Monday. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"313386da-39a2-492e-96df-656d43be9d07","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgoZrzVP4Hdohocxipntx","requestRef":"a43d3468-f3a1-4eb7-84fb-a9e590e090b2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7ec81f2-c51a-49d5-b281-2082cbed24ab","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:28:16.208Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"b7ec81f2-c51a-49d5-b281-2082cbed24ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06369c86-4382-4e7b-a07e-00f01f8f9bda","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WVPLfzUVDRnFNnKyWjfyQK","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"10c18400-3e2a-495c-ac50-0bcd03e440b8","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:28:17.127Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md","content":"# viktortrilar: viktor/bim\n**Goal:** the bird's-eye floor layout Alpo asked for, plus a DXF export, fitted around Sasha's BIM mode on `yasasha/bim`\n**Done:** uncommitted on this branch: app/plan/ (floor image, walls, DXF, IFC), /api/plan routes, web/plan.js and the Plan button, `make bim`, tests/test_plan.py, USAGE. Checked `yasasha/bim` against main: it has the better IFC export, so mine should go. Plan and DXF don't overlap with it\n**Verified:** 9 plan tests passed earlier. Plan screen runs on real data in a headless browser: search, tap, route, no page errors. Main merged with `yasasha/bim` in a scratch copy: no conflicts, 205 tests passed, 19 skipped, lint clean, 0 IFC schema issues, a move in BIM mode took the route from 4.35 to 5.5 m. Not tested: a real BIM tool, 5090, tablet\n**Next:** once Viktor agrees, build on Sasha's branch: remove my IFC export and `make bim`, and use Sasha's `estimate_room` for walls. Then fix the Plan screen: info panel opens behind it, labels overlap, P-005 should show as `P-005?`, the proxy drops the DXF's headers, and the DXF download came back empty in the test browser (cause unknown)\n**Blockers:** waiting on Viktor's decision. Sasha's branch needs a fix for `obj-0144` (fitted 2.08 m across, through the wall) and its usage note, because `make bim` can't pick up operator changes. An agent is fixing routes that ignore moved objects on `viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects`, not finished. Roihu closed until at least Monday. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":["-# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object","-**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes","-**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten","-**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel","-**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049","-**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it","+# viktortrilar: viktor/bim","+**Goal:** the bird's-eye floor layout Alpo asked for, plus a DXF export, fitted around Sasha's BIM mode on `yasasha/bim`","+**Done:** uncommitted on this branch: app/plan/ (floor image, walls, DXF, IFC), /api/plan routes, web/plan.js and the Plan button, `make bim`, tests/test_plan.py, USAGE. Checked `yasasha/bim` against main: it has the better IFC export, so mine should go. Plan and DXF don't overlap with it","+**Verified:** 9 plan tests passed earlier. Plan screen runs on real data in a headless browser: search, tap, route, no page errors. Main merged with `yasasha/bim` in a scratch copy: no conflicts, 205 tests passed, 19 skipped, lint clean, 0 IFC schema issues, a move in BIM mode took the route from 4.35 to 5.5 m. Not tested: a real BIM tool, 5090, tablet","+**Next:** once Viktor agrees, build on Sasha's branch: remove my IFC export and `make bim`, and use Sasha's `estimate_room` for walls. Then fix the Plan screen: info panel opens behind it, labels overlap, P-005 should show as `P-005?`, the proxy drops the DXF's headers, and the DXF download came back empty in the test browser (cause unknown)","+**Blockers:** waiting on Viktor's decision. Sasha's branch needs a fix for `obj-0144` (fitted 2.08 m across, through the wall) and its usage note, because `make bim` can't pick up operator changes. An agent is fixing routes that ignore moved objects on `viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects`, not finished. Roihu closed until at least Monday. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it"]}],"originalFile":"# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object\n**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes\n**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten\n**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel\n**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n","userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"313386da-39a2-492e-96df-656d43be9d07","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","root":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","branch":"viktor/bim","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":7,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":3},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b7ec81f2-c51a-49d5-b281-2082cbed24ab","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
